   "subject": "Re: [geomorph-r-package] 2B-PLS question",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Dear Angie,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">If you have the phylogenetic tree relating your taxa, then you can use the phylogenetic 2B-PLS function phylo.integration(). This will however reduce each group down to a single point (group mean). </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Emma</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><pre><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\">~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</span></font></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:small;white-space:normal\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\">Emma Sherratt, PhD.</font></span></pre><pre><div><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><div><i>University Research Fellow</i></div><div>Department of Genetics and Evolution </div><div>School of Biological Sciences </div><div>The University of Adelaide</div><div>Adelaide, SA 5005</div><div>AUSTRALIA</div><div><br></div><div><i>Honorary Researcher</i></div><div>South Australia Museum</div><div><div>Adelaide, SA 5005</div><div>AUSTRALIA</div></div></span></font></div><div style=\"font-size:small;white-space:normal\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-seri